// IntroString :
"P2028659515" "Everythin's ready. I got the portal all synched up for ya'. You'll be goin' to a base the 'eeroes 'ave established in the pocket dimension they're callin' tha Shadow Shard. The place is called Mole Point Bravo, an' not only is it gonna be full a Longbow troops, but there might also be some a' the human natives on hand talkin' to 'em. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Your job will be to clean tha place out, lock their portals, and secure it all for Arachnos.</A> We're ready whenever you are."
// AcceptString :
"P70015385" "Secure Longbow base in an alternate dimension"
// SendOffString :
"P3059520765" "We've got the portal all set up. Once your through, you'll probably be comin' right into a whole pack a' good guys, so be ready. You'll have to defeat all the base defenders to secure tha place.  You'll also need to lock the portal control computer so they can't send reinforcements, an' capture tha' base commander, too. Oh, an' if there's any a' them human natives there, catch 'em and bring 'em back to us, but they ain't neccessary or nothin'."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1199529026" "Secure Mole Point Bravo"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P511250993" "You'll have to defeat all the base defenders to secure tha place.  You'll also need to lock the portal control computer so they can't send re-enforcement. Finally, if there're any a' them human natives there, catch 'em and bring 'em back to us."

